WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.194
The sky was not blue.

2
00:00:10.195 --> 00:00:13.670
It was gray.

3
00:00:13.671 --> 00:00:18.419
Cat woke up.

4
00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:28.292
"Look at that!" she said.

5
00:00:28.293 --> 00:00:31.861
Little drops came down.

6
00:00:31.862 --> 00:00:36.512
Big drops came down.

7
00:00:36.513 --> 00:00:40.661
"Go away, rain," said Cat.

8
00:00:40.662 --> 00:00:45.646
"I want to play."

9
00:00:45.647 --> 00:00:49.076
"Go away, rain," said Cow.

10
00:00:49.077 --> 00:00:52.918
"I want to see the sun."

11
00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:56.494
"Go away, rain," said Pig.

12
00:00:56.495 --> 00:01:03.166
"I want to eat."

13
00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:08.196
"I don't like rain," said Cat. "I

14
00:01:08.197 --> 00:01:16.528
don't like rain," said Cow. "

15
00:01:16.529 --> 00:01:21.284
We don't like rain," said Pig.

16
00:01:21.285 --> 00:01:24.917
But the rain came down.

17
00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:28.407
The rain did not stop.

18
00:01:28.408 --> 00:01:33.336
The three friends stayed in the barn.

19
00:01:33.337 --> 00:01:44.272
They did not go out.

20
00:01:44.273 --> 00:01:49.433
Pig said, "When will the rain go away?"

21
00:01:49.434 --> 00:01:58.685
Cow said, "What can we do?"

